tr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Useful-Links\">Useful Links</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>County Tax Deed Information</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.kalcounty.com/treasurer/auction.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Auction Information</mark></a><br><strong>County Treasurer</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.kalcounty.com/treasurer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Treasurer&#8217;s Office</mark></a><br><strong>Kalamazoo County</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.kalcounty.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Website</mark></a><br><strong>Auction Site</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Tax-Sale.info</mark></a></p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Pro-Tips\">Pro Tips</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Research Properties</strong>: Make sure the properties you&#8217;re interested in are suitable and check if any are still occupied. You won&#8217;t be able to access these properties without permission​​.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Stay Informed</strong>: Visit the county&#8217;s official site and auction site frequently for updates on auction dates and properties​​.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Frequently-Asked-Questions\">Frequently Asked Questions</h3>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>What happens if I don&#8217;t pay in full within five business days?</strong></li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>You will lose both the deposit and the property.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"2\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Can I see the property before the auction?</strong></li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>You need permission to access the properties, and in many cases, you won’t be able to enter without it.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"3\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>How do I register for the auction in Kalamazoo County</strong> Tax Sale<strong>?</strong></li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Register online at least 48 hours before the auction on <a href=\"https://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Tax-Sale.info</mark></a>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"4\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Are there any other costs involved?</strong></li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Ensure you check for any additional fees or bills accrued post-foreclosure that the buyer may be responsible for.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Need-a-Hand?\">Need a Hand?</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>If you need more guidance with tax lien investing or have any questions, feel free to book a call with us or access our free resources. <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">HERE</mark></a></p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n<p><em>Sign up or log in to view the full content.</em></p><div id=\"popup-overlay\"></div><div id=\"signup-popup\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 20px;\"><h4>Get Instant Free Access To The Training Vault Now</h4><p>Learn how to get 18-36% r